 "remarks": "Nestled on a private road in the heart of Darien, this charming Cape-style home blends timeless craftsmanship with beautifully updated interiors and modern comforts. Featuring 4 spacious bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, the home offers classic New England character with refined elegance throughout. The beautifully updated kitchen features a generous center island, perfect for cooking and gathering, along with a cozy sitting area warmed by a welcoming fireplace. A sunlit family room overlooks the private backyard, creating a bright and inviting space for relaxing or entertaining. All four bedrooms are generously sized with ample closet space, offering comfort and flexibility. The luxurious primary suite is a true retreat, featuring a spa-inspired bathroom with heated floors, an elegant marble shower, and a separate dressing area. Beautifully updated bathrooms and thoughtful finishes add to the home's timeless appeal. Outside, the private backyard offers a peaceful setting for outdoor enjoyment. Ideally located just minutes from downtown Darien, shopping, dining, and the Metro-North train, this exceptional home offers the perfect balance of privacy and convenience. Enjoy all that Darien has to offer, including its highly regarded schools, beautiful beaches, and vibrant community.",
